---
import SiteLayout from "~/layouts/site-layout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "~/components/site-header.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="About — Aceh Institute" canonical="/about/">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="about">
    <p class="kicker">ABOUT</p>
    <h1>Aceh has more legal room than its economy shows.</h1>
    <p>
      Aceh Institute is an independent research initiative on Aceh's special autonomy. Its first product,
      <strong>Aceh 2045 · Production Autonomy</strong>, is a source-linked deck: what the Helsinki MoU promised,
      what Law 11/2006 enacted, what was never implemented, and a production agenda that uses the powers Aceh
      already holds before asking Jakarta for precise new ones.
    </p>
    <h2>Method</h2>
    <p>
      Every number carries a publisher and a date. Only primary-source figures or official figures reported via
      news are charted; derived numbers say "derived", proposals say "proposal". Research cutoff: 30 August 2026.
      Unverified items remain tagged on the slides.
    </p>
    <h2>Licence</h2>
    <p>
      The website code is open source under the MIT licence. The slides, research notes, generated images and the
      Aceh Institute name are copyright © 2026 Radja Thaher, all rights reserved. Quote with attribution; ask
      before reproducing.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>[Author name · email]</p>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: var(--container-prose);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px 24px 96px;
  }
  .kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-source);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
    color: var(--color-red);
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-web-h1);
    line-height: var(--leading-web-h1);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 8px 0 24px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-web-h2);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    margin: 40px 0 8px;
  }
</style>
